  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Saameynta-Scaling-Up Solutions to Displacement in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme addresses Somalia&#x2019;s internal displacement challenges in an innovative manner, seeking durable solutions that are affordable and sustainable through addressing specific inter-related systemic blockages, challenges, and opportunities. The project seeks to strengthen capacities (technical and institutional) of local authorities in Baidoa, Bossaso and Beletweyne to address urban displacement through capacity building and support in the development of relevant land-related policies to improve tenure security for displacement affected communities and reduce the risk of forced eviction.</narrative>
  </description>
